{"sections":[],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK"]]},"kind":"article","primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"Overview","text":"Overview","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/YBVRPlayerManager\/switchContent(to:_:)","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" replaces the content playing in a live player. It"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"keeps the player, the rendering surface, and the immersive space intact, which makes it the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"right call for “up next” rails, recommendation panels, and channel switching. Creating a new"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/YBVRPlayerManager","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" per video would instead drop and rebuild the surface — on visionOS that"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"means visibly leaving and re-entering the immersive space."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If the player has not started anything yet, "},{"code":"switchContent(to:_:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" falls back to","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/YBVRPlayerManager\/startStream(video:_:)","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":", so it is safe to call as the single entry point"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"for playback."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Changing the ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"player"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" rather than the video — moving a session from an immersive space into a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"window, say — is the opposite trade and needs a new manager: see ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/SwitchingPlayerMode","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]},{"level":2,"anchor":"Switching","text":"Switching","type":"heading"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"As with ","type":"text"},{"code":"startStream","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", pre-fetching the signaling file removes a network round trip from","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"inside the switch:","type":"text"}]},{"code":["func switchTo(video newVideo: Video) async {","    guard newVideo != currentVideo else { return }","","    do {","        let signaling = try await player.fetchSignalingFile(video: newVideo)","        try await player.switchContent(to: newVideo, signaling)","    } catch {","        loadFailure = error.localizedDescription","    }","}"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The switch tears down the previous item, stops analytics tracking for it, resolves the new","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"item’s signaling, and starts the new stream. Analytics restart automatically for the new","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"content.","type":"text"}]},{"level":2,"anchor":"Reflecting-the-Transition-in-Your-UI","text":"Reflecting the Transition in Your UI","type":"heading"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/YBVRPlayerManager\/isSwitchingContent","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" is "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"true"},{"type":"text","text":" for the duration of the call. Drive a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"loading state from it, and disable the controls that would race the switch:"}]},{"code":["player.isSwitchingContent","    .receive(on: DispatchQueue.main)","    .sink { [weak self] switching in","        self?.isSwitchingContent = switching","    }","    .store(in: &cancellables)"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"code":["Button(\"Play\") { … }","    .disabled(vm.isSwitchingContent)"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Re-bind your player subscriptions around a switch rather than reusing them."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"Which bindings apply depends on the content — a control room item exposes a camera selector","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and per-camera language sets that a flat item does not. Cancel your subscriptions, call","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"switchContent","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", then re-subscribe and re-read","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/YBVRPlayerManager\/controlRoomSelectorViewModel()"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]}],"type":"aside","name":"Important","style":"important"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Reset your own transport state as part of the switch too: position, duration, subtitle cue,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and the selected audio and subtitle languages all belong to the outgoing item.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"Reacting-to-Playback-Ending","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Reacting to Playback Ending"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/YBVRPlayerManager\/itemDidEnd"},{"type":"text","text":" publishes the "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/Video","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" that just finished. Use it to chain","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"straight into the next item rather than dismissing the player:","type":"text"}]},{"code":["player.itemDidEnd","    .receive(on: DispatchQueue.main)","    .sink { [weak self] finished in","        guard let next = self?.nextUp(after: finished) else { return }","        Task { await self?.switchTo(video: next) }","    }","    .store(in: &cancellables)"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"text":"Handling Failures","anchor":"Handling-Failures","type":"heading","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/YBVRPlayerManager\/playbackError","isActive":true},{"text":" reports errors that surface after playback has begun, as","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"distinct from the error thrown by the ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"switchContent"},{"type":"text","text":" call itself:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["player.playbackError","    .receive(on: DispatchQueue.main)","    .sink { [weak self] error in","        self?.loadFailure = error.localizedDescription","    }","    .store(in: &cancellables)"]},{"text":"Ads and Switching","level":2,"anchor":"Ads-and-Switching","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"A schedule set through ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/YBVRPlayerManager\/ads","isActive":true},{"text":" belongs to the content it was scheduled","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"against and is cleared when the content changes. Schedule the new item’s breaks after the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"switch completes — see ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/AdInsertion","type":"reference"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/ybvrapplesdk\/contentswitching"]}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Move an existing player from one video to another without tearing it down."}],"metadata":{"role":"article","title":"Switching Content","modules":[{"name":"YBVRAppleSDK"}],"roleHeading":"Article"},"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/ContentSwitching","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"seeAlsoSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/SwitchingPlayerMode","doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/AdInsertion","doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/Drm"],"generated":true,"anchor":"Guides","title":"Guides"}],"references":{"doc://applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK/documentation/YBVRAppleSDK/YBVRPlayerManager/ads":{"fragments":[{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"ads","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:12YBVRAppleSDK16YBVRAdControllerC","text":"YBVRAdController","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"title":"ads","role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/ybvrapplesdk\/ybvrplayermanager\/ads","abstract":[{"text":"Ad breaks: the schedule, the skip control, and the state a host binds its ad UI to.","type":"text"}],"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/YBVRPlayerManager\/ads","kind":"symbol"},"doc://applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK/documentation/YBVRAppleSDK/Video":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/Video","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Video"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"Video"}],"role":"symbol","type":"topic","title":"Video","abstract":[],"url":"\/documentation\/ybvrapplesdk\/video","kind":"symbol"},"doc://applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK/documentation/YBVRAppleSDK/YBVRPlayerManager/playbackError":{"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"let"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"playbackError"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdent